            <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Set your filters on the left-hand side, and both tables will get re-calculated. The bottom table is the aggregation of the one above it. If you use the &quot;Running Sum of % of Tot Vert GMV&quot; filter, the bottom table will have to be re-calculated manually. To do that, click on the column title &quot;GMV Eur&quot; after adjusting the filter.</run>
